{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Background</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are Yuto Fujimoto, a computer genius. As a fresh graduate, you want to live an easy life chilling at home, but to survive you still need a job. It just so happens Facibook is recruiting community content moderators.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u201cA censor job, huh? Not my style, but at least it pays the bills and I can do it from home.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your application is quickly accepted and you are now committed to censor images every day. Tomorrow is day one of the new job\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Censoring may seem boring and repetitive, but you may be able to FLIP THE WORLD AROUND!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/Player.jpg?t=1749054321\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Computer genius Yuto Fujimoto finds himself unemployed after graduating college. Wanting an easy life, he gets a job at Facibook as a censor. Editing online content may be boring, but Yuto FLIPS THE WORLD AROUND!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/Girl1.jpg?t=1749054321\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Misa Hashimoto - The manager of Yuto's apartment. She is married and very kind to Yuto and everyone else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Innovative Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755480/extras/minigame.jpg?t=1749054321\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph